GD: image creation and manipulation with the libgd bundled in PHP 5.6,
with FreeType, PNG and JPEG of the package az (GIF of libgd itself;
no WebP: the libgd of PHP 5.6 takes it from libvpx, which az has not).

The module gd of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/gd.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d, its
headers in include/php56/php/ext/gd.
